<title>JAPAN: KINKI COCA-COLA - 6MTH PARENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>KINKI COCA-COLA - 6MTH PARENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 73.41		vs	   69.79</p>
<p> Operating	    2.96		vs	    3.23</p>
<p> Current		3.11		vs	    3.55</p>
<p> Net		  738    million    vs	  808    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.41 yen	  vs	   13.62 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     60 million	  vs	  59 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    6.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kinki Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd is a major Coca-Cola bottler based in Osaka.</p>
</text>
